 },
 "paragraphs": [
  {
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Ever since GTA 6 came out, I keep seeing the same comment.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d6",
       "t": 45.0,
       "label": "GTA VI · 2026"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Rockstar finally added dating. A girlfriend, romance, a couple at the center of the story.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d6",
       "t": 1.0,
       "label": "GTA VI · 2026"
      },
      {
       "src": "d61",
       "t": 67.5,
       "label": "GTA VI · 2026"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Something GTA has never done before.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d61",
       "t": 6.0,
       "label": "GTA VI · 2026"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Except it has.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d1",
       "t": 32.0,
       "boom": 0.15,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Dating in GTA is twenty two years old.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "THE PROOF",
       "title": "DATING IN GTA|IS 22 YEARS OLD",
       "bg": "d11",
       "t": 26
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "In this video, I'll show you all of it: San Andreas, GTA 4, and why so many people think it's brand new.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d13",
       "t": 1.5,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      },
      {
       "src": "d22",
       "t": 9.0,
       "label": "GTA IV · 2008"
      },
      {
       "src": "d6",
       "t": 24.0,
       "label": "GTA VI · 2026"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Let's go back to 2004.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "2004",
       "title": "GTA SAN ANDREAS",
       "bg": "d1",
       "t": 24
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Grand Theft Auto San Andreas gave CJ six girlfriends.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d11",
       "t": 16.3,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      },
      {
       "src": "d11",
       "t": 18.9,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Two of them are part of the story. The other four, you meet out in the world.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d12",
       "t": 28.0,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      },
      {
       "src": "d12",
       "t": 21.0,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "And he meets the first one, Denise, in the worst way possible.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d1",
       "t": 2.0,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "A corrupt cop, Frank Tenpenny, orders CJ to burn down a house.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d1",
       "t": 12.5,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "When the house is already on fire, he hears a woman screaming inside.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d1",
       "t": 23.5,
       "speed": 0.85,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "So he runs back into the fire and gets her out.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d1",
       "t": 34.5,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "That's Denise. And she becomes his girlfriend.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d13",
       "t": 10.0,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "And this wasn't just a cutscene. Dating was a whole system.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d13",
       "t": 13.5,
       "speed": 0.9,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "You picked her up, took her out to eat or for a drink, and drove her home.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d11",
       "t": 22.0,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      },
      {
       "src": "d11",
       "t": 30.3,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      },
      {
       "src": "d13",
       "t": 23.5,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Every good date filled up her progress bar. Ignore her for too long, and it started to drop.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d11",
       "t": 25.5,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      },
      {
       "src": "d11",
       "t": 34.0,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Some girlfriends were picky.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d12",
       "t": 31.5,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Katie, a nurse in San Fierro, only liked muscular guys, so you'd hit the gym before you even asked her out.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d12",
       "t": 35.5,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      },
      {
       "src": "d12",
       "t": 41.0,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "And dating her paid off. If CJ got wasted, he kept all his weapons.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d12",
       "t": 48.0,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      },
      {
       "src": "d12",
       "t": 55.5,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Barbara, in El Quebrados, did the same for when he got busted.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d11",
       "t": 38.5,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      },
      {
       "src": "d11",
       "t": 46.5,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Dating in San Andreas even caused the biggest scandal in GTA history.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "2005",
       "title": "THE HOT COFFEE|SCANDAL",
       "bg": "d13",
       "t": 12,
       "boom": 0.1
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "In 2005, a mod unlocked a hidden minigame left in the game's code, and San Andreas got re-rated Adults Only and pulled from store shelves.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d11",
       "t": 4.0,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      },
      {
       "src": "d12",
       "t": 1.0,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "That was twenty one years before GTA 6.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d1",
       "t": 41.0,
       "label": "GTA SAN ANDREAS · 2004"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Four years later, GTA 4 took dating online.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "card": "2008",
       "title": "GTA IV|ONLINE DATING",
       "bg": "d22",
       "t": 147
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Niko Bellic found three of his girlfriends on dating sites inside the game.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d22",
       "t": 145.0,
       "crop": [
        70,
        30,
        480,
        270
       ],
       "label": "GTA IV · 2008"
      },
      {
       "src": "d22",
       "t": 148.5,
       "crop": [
        300,
        80,
        320,
        180
       ],
       "label": "GTA IV · 2008"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Alex posted an ad on the in-game craplist: party girl seeks man for fun and blog material.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d22",
       "t": 153.0,
       "crop": [
        70,
        30,
        480,
        270
       ],
       "label": "GTA IV · 2008"
      },
      {
       "src": "d22",
       "t": 177.4,
       "crop": [
        80,
        50,
        400,
        225
       ],
       "w": 1.4,
       "label": "GTA IV · 2008"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "And yes, she really did keep a blog.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d22",
       "t": 188.4,
       "crop": [
        120,
        40,
        320,
        180
       ],
       "label": "GTA IV · 2008"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Their first date: a diner.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d22",
       "t": 12.0,
       "label": "GTA IV · 2008"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "listen": [
      "d22",
      1.3,
      6.3
     ],
     "label": "GTA IV · 2008",
     "subs": [
      [
       1.38,
       2.9,
       "ALEX: Let's eat here."
      ],
      [
       2.96,
       6.1,
       "ALEX: It's not exactly going to be a gastronomic rollercoaster, though, is it?"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "On the drive home, they talk about her blog.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d22",
       "t": 24.0,
       "label": "GTA IV · 2008"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "listen": [
      "d22",
      35.4,
      47.45
     ],
     "label": "GTA IV · 2008",
     "subs": [
      [
       35.62,
       39.2,
       "NIKO: So, this blog you write, is that all you want to do?"
      ],
      [
       39.5,
       41.8,
       "ALEX: God, I've never thought of it that way."
      ],
      [
       42.2,
       44.45,
       "ALEX: I've never thought that writing my blog was doing something."
      ],
      [
       44.74,
       47.35,
       "ALEX: It's just an extension of my personality. I'm creative."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "And if the date went well, Niko could ask to come in.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d22",
       "t": 19.2,
       "label": "GTA IV · 2008"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "listen": [
      "d22",
      56.7,
      59.85
     ],
     "label": "GTA IV · 2008",
     "subs": [
      [
       56.82,
       58.65,
       "NIKO: You want me to come in?"
      ],
      [
       58.84,
       59.75,
       "ALEX: I'd like that, Niko."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Every girlfriend had her own taste.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d23",
       "t": 0.4,
       "label": "GTA IV · 2008"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Carmen, a nurse, loved bars and darts, but gave Burger Shot only fifty percent.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d23",
       "t": 3.3,
       "crop": [
        0,
        0,
        533,
        300
       ],
       "repeat": true,
       "label": "GTA IV · 2008"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "She even cared about what Niko was wearing.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d23",
       "t": 9.0,
       "label": "GTA IV · 2008"
      },
      {
       "src": "d23",
       "t": 25.0,
       "label": "GTA IV · 2008"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "And girlfriends came with perks.",
     "shots": [
      {
       "src": "d23",
       "t": 33.0,
       "label": "GTA IV · 2008"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Carmen could heal Niko over the phone. Kiki could make his wanted level disappear. And Alex got him half price on clothes.",
     "shots": [
      {
